		'read_time', 3
	),
	'Property Tests for "Must Never" Rules',
	'Put retention, limits and permission rules in a module with no I/O, then state what must never happen and let a generator hunt for the case that breaks it.',
	'Put retention, limits and permission rules in a module with no I/O, then state what must never happen and let a generator hunt for the case that breaks it.',
	'markdown',
