		'read_time', 2
	),
	'Notification Badge Behavior',
	'A badge counts things that need attention. Decide what clears it, cap the number, and tell assistive technology without shouting.',
	'A badge counts things that need attention. Decide what clears it, cap the number, and tell assistive technology without shouting.',
	'markdown',
	CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
	130
